      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This integration test demonstrates the issue described in \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-1258\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-1258\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Many blank nodes under /.well-known/genid/\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-1258\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n.</p>",
     "created": "16/Jan/15 12:07 PM",
     "id": "12800",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11247/comment/12800",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "16/Jan/15 12:07 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>It appears that the test itself, is exhausting socket resources which causes the failure. <br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/umd-lib/fcrepo4/blob/feature/fcrepo-1257/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/http/api/FedoraBlankNodesIT.java\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/umd-lib/fcrepo4/blob/feature/fcrepo-1257/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/java/org/fcrepo/integration/http/api/FedoraBlankNodesIT.java</a></p>\n\n<p>The following, analogous, test evokes the performance issue (where \"mods.ttl\" is the file: <a href=\"https://github.com/umd-lib/fcrepo4/blob/feature/fcrepo-1257/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/test-blank-nodes/with_blank_nodes.ttl):\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/umd-lib/fcrepo4/blob/feature/fcrepo-1257/fcrepo-http-api/src/test/resources/test-blank-nodes/with_blank_nodes.ttl):</a><br/>\n=================<br/>\ntime for x in </p>\n{0..50000}\n<p>; do echo \"--- $x\"; curl -s -XPOST --data-binary @mods.ttl -H\"Content-Type: text/turtle\" localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/test/collection0; done<br/>\n=================</p>",
     "created": "23/Jan/15 7:04 PM",
     "id": "13202",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11247/comment/13202",
